    "description": {
      "en": "The taper (withdrawal) rate applied to the PRSI Class A employee credit, used as the Withdraw_Rate parameter in tscee_ie's BenCalc function for the 'PRSI Class A: credit (per month in work)'. Its value of 1/6 matches the Country Report's description of the credit as '€12 less one-sixth of weekly earnings above €352.01', i.e. the credit is reduced by one-sixth of every euro of weekly earnings above the threshold until it is fully withdrawn."
